# Raw gif captures live in Git LFS: large, rarely changed, and never requested
# by the site. Only the top level matches -- Data/gifs/mini/ is deliberately
# left in normal git, because GitHub Pages serves LFS-backed files as their
# pointer text rather than the real bytes. Anything the site links to must stay
# out of LFS.
Data/gifs/*.gif filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
